  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mvi 103.01 Composition of Board. Pursuant to RSA 357-C:12, I, the board consists of the commissioner and 6 members, appointed by governor and council for a term specified by law.\n\nSource. #6485, INTERIM, eff 4-16-97, EXPIRED: 8-14-97\n\nNew. #6650, eff 12-10-97",
